\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22\cell *: Tick-tock, tick-tock! Oh dear, oh dear! I shall be too late, I fear!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If someone doesn't step in to save the day, Tickington's time is well and truly up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tick-tock, the clock won't stop! It really is five minutes to midnight! If only there were someone who could come to our aid!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hold on a tick! You've clocked me, am I right? Can it be true!? Can you really see me!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, it's about time\emdash I was beginning to think I was totally invisible!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, come now! That really ticks me off! There's no time for that nonsense! Of course you can see me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This can only mean one thing\emdash you're a hero, aren't you? Oh, tickety-boo! You're finally here, and not a moment too soon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a pleasure to meet you, Mister Hero! My name's Ickle. I'm a tockle, from over Tickington way...and we need your help!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell We're having a terrible time of it at the moment. Can I ask you to come and be the hero of the hour?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell ...What!? We don't have time for your silliness! You're a hero! You've got to help us! It's your job!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Whew! Thank you, Mister Hero! I knew it wouldn't take you more than a moment's thought to agree!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Uh...<pc>? Are you talking to yourself now?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Has the sun gone to your head or something?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Well, the clock is ticking! Come on! It's time to show you and your friends the way to Tickington! Follow me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Hold on! What just happened!? Things went all wavy and suddenly we're in this weird village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Oh look! He's so adorable! But...who is he?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Tick-tock, it looks like you clocked me too! You must be Mister Hero here's friends! Welcome to Tickington, a place that's just a little bit out of the ordinary...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Normally, only certain special people can see us tockle types, but the second even ordinary folk set foot here in our home, they can see us too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Uhh, I think we might need a little background here. Like, who are you? Where are we? Why the heck are we here? You know, just the small stuff.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell How about you start from the beginning?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell ...The beginning? Yes, yes, of course! The beginning! Tickety-boo! Allow me to explain!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell We are the tockles, and we live here in the village of Tickington. It's a very peculiar place, where time flows a little differently from the way it does in Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell It's our sworn duty to make sure that time flows as it should, that past, present and future are all in the right order, and that all is unfolding as intended. In other words, we make sure everything's tickety-boo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Ah, hang on a tick! I need to tell the Mayor you're here! Why don't we let him explain the rest?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Just head up the stairs and you'll find him in a very special place we call the Echo Chamber. So come on, shake a leg! The clock's ticking, and there's no time like the present!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Tut-tut-tock! There you are! Where in space and time have you been!? You promised you'd come to our rescue, remember?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Hmm... Judging by the look on your dial, I'd say you've forgotten all about the tockles of Tickington...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Well, it looks like it's time for a gentle reminder, then! Hopefully this will bring you up to speed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell ...Tick-tock, did that reset the clock? You promised that you'd save us! Remember now?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell There's not a moment to lose\emdash you need to speak to the Mayor! You'll find him in a very special place we call the Echo Chamber. So come on, shake a leg!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell It's up at the top of the stairs. Now, get going! The clock's ticking, and there's no time like the present!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Tick-tock, look who I've got! It's the Luminary, and not a moment too soon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, what marvellous timing! Welcome to Tickington! My name is Stickle, and I am the mayor of this fine place beyond space and time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Now, the clock is ticking, so I will be brief. My people have a sacred mission, and that is why we have sought you out. Take a look at the tomes that sit on the altars around us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell In these sacred volumes are inscribed the tales of hallowed heroes from other worlds and other ages.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Since time immemorial, the duty of my people has been to guard these books, and to ensure that the great deeds of the past live on in the present.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell That is why we created the place where we now stand. The Echo Chamber\emdash a sacred space where the adventure logs of all the hallowed heroes of old can be kept safe from the ravages of time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell ...Or so we had thought. But this holy haven has been sullied by an unknown miscreant, who took it upon themselves to tear whole pages from our beloved books, and liberally daub others with ink.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell I am afraid I have no idea who committed this heinous crime, but what I do know is that as things stand, the heroic happenings of the past risk being lost forever. History itself hangs in the balance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Which is where you come in. As the hero of your own age, I must ask you to right this wrong. I must ask you to plunge into each of these volumes, and set time on the right path once more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell But before you dive in, you must first learn the sacred incantations that will enable you to turn back the clock. The pastwords.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Sadly, these were long since scattered across Erdrea. This being so, I have entrusted my most dependable tockles with the momentous task of seeking them out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Should you find one of my friends here in the course of your travels, stop a moment and speak with them. With luck, they will have learned the words that will enable you to journey through the pages of the ages.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell When you have learned one, you will be able to return here and visit the very legends of the greatest heroes known to space and time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Now, if I am not becoming confused in my old age, young Ickle managed to find a pastword just the other day. Come, my little tick-tock tyke\emdash share what you have learned with our friend!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Yes, sir! Tock-tick, let's make this quick!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Now, prick up your ears, because I'll say this only once!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell Ickle tells <pc> the pastword he's found!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell He can now visit Galenholm via the Altar of Origins!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Why not strike while time's on your side and take a closer look at that altar over there? A whole new world of adventure awaits! Come on, there's no time like the present!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Tick-tock, look who I've got! It's the Luminary, and not a moment too soon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
