\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Why not strike while time's on your side and take a closer look at that altar over there? A whole new world of adventure awaits! Come on, there's no time like the present!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Ah, so you have returned! And what tales do you have to regale me with this time, hm?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells the Mayor of Tickington everything that happened during his adventures in the past.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Goodness me! Galenholm was besieged by monsters, you say?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Hmm... Perhaps these are merely the musings of an old man, but I have a feeling that the vandal who defaced our beloved books may be attempting to rewrite history itself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell But as long as you are able visit each of the heroic ages and right the wrongs that have been wrought there, the proper flow of time will be restored soon enough.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell In which case, you'll need to continue to seek out and speak with the tockles who are travelling the length and breadth of Erdrea in search of pastwords.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell The more of them you learn, the more ancient ages you will be able to visit. If anyone can find them all and put things right, it's you! It's time for you to shine, dear hero!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell As tockles, our sacred mission has always been to ensure that the great deeds of the past remain intact for the sake of the future. But we need your help. Please\emdash history itself hangs in the balance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
