\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Goodness me! Galenholm was besieged by monsters, you say?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Hmm... Perhaps these are merely the musings of an old man, but I have a feeling that the vandal who defaced our beloved books may be attempting to rewrite history itself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell But as long as you are able visit each of the heroic ages and right the wrongs that have been wrought there, the proper flow of time will be restored soon enough.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell In which case, you'll need to continue to seek out and speak with the tockles who are travelling the length and breadth of Erdrea in search of pastwords.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell The more of them you learn, the more ancient ages you will be able to visit. If anyone can find them all and put things right, it's you! It's time for you to shine, dear hero!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell As tockles, our sacred mission has always been to ensure that the great deeds of the past remain intact for the sake of the future. But we need your help. Please\emdash history itself hangs in the balance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Lord Dragon\cell Grah hah hahhh! So you have come! Quail before Lord Dragon, granted unimaginable power by the mighty Dragonlord! 'Twas I who did defile the first tome!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Wyrmalroth\cell And it was I, Wyrmalroth, who did desecrate the second of those deplorable volumes! My power was the gift of that malign master of malevolence, Malroth!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Zomaiden\cell It will not surprise you to learn that the third of those accursed tomes was corrupted by my hand! I am Zomaiden, a vessel into which the peerlessly evil Zoma has poured his powers!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Lord Dragon\cell We have eagerly awaited the arrival of one such as thee! You see, we have an offer for you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Lord Dragon\cell Come! Take thy rightful place at our side! Do so, and we will grant unto thee dominion over half this world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Lord Dragon\cell ...Very well. In truth, we are not quite able to offer that much...but we would like to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Lord Dragon\cell Alas, we are mere avatars, brought into being by our master, and tasked with despoiling the pages of history, and laying waste to any so-called heroes who would stand in our way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Wyrmalroth\cell What power we have was bestowed upon us for one purpose and one purpose alone\emdash ensuring that your end is a swift and painful one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Zomaiden\cell <pc>, you are courageous indeed to attempt to thwart the will of the almighty evil we serve! But you shall pay a heavy price for your boldness!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
