\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Nimclops\cell And it was I, Nimclops who so bravely vandalised the fifth! I serve Grandmaster Nimzo, the mighty and most maleficent master of wickedness!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Mortamammoth\cell As for the sixth of those tedious tales of the so-called heroes of times past, it was none other than I, Mortamammoth, born of the might of Mortamor, who wrought untold damage upon it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Nimclops\cell We have witnessed all that you have done in your attempts to restore the past that we have gone to such great lengths to desecrate!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Nimclops\cell Your efforts were not trifling, and none can deny your courage and resolve. However, you must know that they all for naught!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Mortamammoth\cell Quite so! And now we will teach you just how insignificant you really are! We serve the ultimate evil, and it is this evil that will rewrite history in the blood of its victims\emdash beginning with yours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Psaroid\cell We do not pretend to fully understand the will of our master, but we know that any who stand in his way will be destroyed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
