\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Psaroid\cell Rrraaarrrgh! It burns! It burns! My body...! My beautiful body...! I feel it falling apart...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
