P R E P A R E T O W I T N E S S T H E E N D!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Uh-oh! If he unleashes his full power all at once, then it really will be curtains for all of us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell This isn't good. What are we going to do?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The End of Time\cell Only kidding!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The End of Time\cell Hur hur hur! The look on your faces! ...Sorry, sorry. I'm sorry, honestly! I didn't mean to frighten you like that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The End of Time\cell Come on\emdash don't take it to heart! I wasn't really going to destroy the world! That wasn't my plan at all! It was all just a big wheeze\emdash a practical joke!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The End of Time\cell I'm not the End of Time! Quite the reverse, actually! I love time! I'm all for it! In fact, it's my job to look after it. Make sure it's running smoothly, all that stuff. You can call me...the Friend of Time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell How interesting... But if that's the case, then why would you attack us like that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell Simple\emdash I was testing whether or not you had what it takes to defeat Calasmos!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell That fellow and I are two sides of the same coin, you see. We both have divine powers, but he chose to use his for evil. And I...well, I can't be having that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell I've been looking for the best way to teach him a lesson, and I hit upon the bright idea of gently encouraging the Luminary to defeat him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell But I didn't want you to get in over your head, so I needed to know if you were up to the challenge. That's why I messed around with those books and rewrote history. It was all to test you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell In retrospect, it wasn't the most subtle way to put you through your paces, but it was all I could come up with at the time and...anyway, all's well that ends well, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell So, long story short, you aced it! You restored the flow of history and, as if that wasn't enough, you even defeated me! Not bad going!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell You are very much qualified to bear the name of the Luminary, and to take on Calasmos! You more than deserve to take your place in the pantheon of heroes, and have your own statue in the Echo Chamber!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell ...You know, the more I think about it, memory really is an extraordinary thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell Time flows, the sands of the hourglass fall, and\emdash for most people, at least\emdash there's no going back. But the memories of those times, well...they last forever. And they're what connects us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell Your own memories of saving your own world, the other heroes' memories of saving theirs... They're the glue that binds us all together.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell And by doing all you've done, you've created memories that will see you through thick and thin. No matter how hard things get, you'll always have them to support you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell Anyway, I'm sure you don't want to hear any more of my blathering. I'd say it's about time you were off back to your friends in Tickington.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell You've passed my test with the most flying of colours, and I can say with absolute confidence that you'll be able to take on Calasmos. I'll be cheering you all the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl The Friend of Time\cell Goodbye! And good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Tickety-boo! You made it back! And what marvellous timing\emdash we were all just wondering how you were getting on!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Well, all this excitement has really got my ticker going! So none other than the Friend of Time was behind all this? Well, I never!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell The tockles and the Friend of Time go back a long way, you know. It was he who originally gave us our sacred mission to guard the legacy of the heroes of times past.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell For him to have wilfully damaged the tomes that contain those hallowed tales... Well, he must have had a very good reason, that's all I can say.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell But whatever lay behind all this, one thing's for certain\emdash we are truly grateful to you. Thanks to your epic efforts, we can continue to do what we have always done, and protect the correct flow of time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell Now, I think it's high time we let you go\emdash I know you have an awful lot to do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell We'll miss you, but time waits for no man, and we can't keep you here forever. Thank you for everything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Ickle the Tockle\cell Truly, you will be a hero to all tockles for the rest of time! And if you happen to clock one of us on your travels, take a second to say hello, won't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1897\cellx10324 
\pard\intbl Stickle\cell You'll always be welcome here in Tickington! You can count on it! Now, watch how you go!\cell\row 
